license: MIT
abstract: "A local-first desktop interface for locally managed language models and repository-grounded exploration of scientific dynamical-model repositories. Ask the Model v0.6.1 corrects live GISTEMP chart rendering to use the complete pinned source independently of retrieved evidence excerpts, and recognizes clear natural-language chart requests while preserving the explicit command and source-revalidated GISTEMP boundary. It retains the v0.6.0 presentation, History and default-OFF optimization boundaries."
keywords:
  - local AI
  - local-first
  - large language models
  - Ollama
  - retrieval
  - provenance
  - scientific models
  - dynamical models
  - natural-language interface
  - research software
